<title>UK: RUGBY LEAGUE-WIGAN BEAT ST HELENS IN ENGLISH PREMIERSHIP FINAL.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-WIGAN BEAT ST HELENS IN ENGLISH PREMIERSHIP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wigan beat St Helens</p>
<p>44-14 (halftime 18-8) in the English rugby league premiership</p>
<p>final at Old Trafford on Sunday.</p>
</text>
